NoConnect is a modified version of Briar (https://briarproject.org),
Copyright (C) The Briar Project, licensed under the GNU General Public License
version 3. The code base is a snapshot of Briar release 1.5.21 (commit
aea0e4a6c149e5aeaf1ef603792cd073314cf701), with these modules mapped:

  nc-api, nc-core, nc-android, nc-java                  <- bramble-api/core/android/java
  noconnect-api, noconnect-core, noconnect-android,     <- briar-api/core/android/headless
  noconnect-headless

Modifications include renaming of modules, packages, classes, resources,
strings and protocol identifiers (tools/rename-upstream.py), a new logo,
removal of RSS feeds and of crash-report upload, and the other changes
recorded in this repository's git history.

